Package: skanyxx
Version: SKANYXX_VERSION
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Skanyxx <admin@skanyxx.dev>
Installed-Size: 120000
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libicu78 | libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3
Recommends: curl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/skanyxx/skanyxx
Description: Skanyxx desktop launcher
 Opens your company's Skanyxx agent workspace from http://localhost:5282
 (Skanyxx:Mode Remote, Skanyxx:RemoteUrl). The Skanyxx server itself is
 installed with the Helm chart; a full local Skanyxx (Mode Server) is a
 dev console only.
